olors_spent` on card after mana payment for Converge mechanic. `_resolve_spell()` reads targets from `StackObject.targets` (single source of truth) and sets `card.chosen_targets` at resolve time. Validates `filter_fn` on targets at cast time. |\n/workspace/engine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:49:- Tests in `tests/engine/` — one test file per module (e.g., `test_types.py`, `test_card.py`), plus `test_lazy_targets.py` (lazy filter evaluation) and `test_chosen_targets_refactor.py` (resolve-time target availability).\n/workspace/engine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:50:- ~1,140+ engine-specific tests covering all modules (including hybrid mana, cost reduction, protection, extra turns, lazy targets, chosen_targets refactor).\n/workspace/engine/card.py:218:        Targets are available via ``self.chosen_targets`` — set at\n/workspace/engine/stack.py:81:    (chosen_targets, etc.) while sharing class method bindings.  Binds\n/workspace/engine/stack.py:108:        copied_card.chosen_targets = copy_obj.targets\n/workspace/engine/casting.py:176:    chosen_targets: list[Any] = []\n/workspace/engine/casting.py:190:            chosen_targets.append(target)\n/workspace/engine/casting.py:196:    for target in chosen_targets:\n/workspace/engine/casting.py:238:        targets=chosen_targets,\ngrep: /workspace/engine/__pycache__/stack.cpython-311.pyc: binary file matches\ngrep: /workspace/engine/__pycache__/casting.cpython-311.pyc: binary file matches","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019wra6EmWmTtLaxxsw3e9Az","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"254804a4-553e-4d95-bc98-e3272959576e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T08:31:06.699Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_1"}
