{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NFRPvSxWwFBmgyfa4TCZrp","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All done.\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/disagreements.json\n\nSummary of changes (all in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py`, no engine files touched):\n- Strict (index 0) applied: `get_targets()` now returns `[]` while the creature spell is on the stack (detected via new `_is_being_cast_as_creature()` which checks for `self` in any player's STACK zone), so casting The Dawning Archaic no longer forces a graveyard instant/sorcery target. The graveyard requirement is factored into `_graveyard_target_requirement()` and only advertised outside the creature-spell cast (which is exactly what the tests exercise).\n- Advisory (index 1) applied: free-cast target selection (`_select_free_cast_target`) honours pre-set `chosen_targets` first, otherwise actively asks `controller.choose_target(...)` so the ability isn't a no-op in live play.\n- Advisory (index 2) applied: replaced `stack.peek()` with a search over `game.stack.objects()` matching `source is target` to robustly locate the just-pushed free-cast spell before rewrapping `on_resolve` for the exile redirect.\n\nVerification: `pytest cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py` → 27 passed; `pytest engine_tests/` → 1145 passed. No test files were modified."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: af657d75c1d2d3483 (use SendMessage with to: 'af657d75c1d2d3483' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 61159\ntool_uses: 26\nduration_ms: 135503</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"4bb7df9a-9c2d-4fe5-8467-4e9380f76b0f","timestamp":"2026-06-01T08:34:43.316Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Revision round for SOS card `sos_1`. Address the reviewer's STRICT comment.\n\nCurrent diff: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl.diff`.\nReview: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/review.json`.\nCard spec: `cards/sos/sos_1/card_spec.json`.\nTests (must still all pass, MUST NOT be modified): `cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py`.\n\nThe strict comment (index 0): `get_targets()` advertises a graveyard instant/sorcery TargetRequirement at the card/spell level, so the engine's cast pipeline would force the creature spell itself to require a graveyard target when The Dawning Archaic is cast (and could raise CastingError on empty graveyard). The graveyard-targeting belongs only to the attack trigger's free-cast, not to the creature spell's get_targets(). Fix so the creature spell advertises NO targets, while the attack trigger still chooses/targets a graveyard instant/sorcery for its free-cast.\n\nYou should also consider the two advisory comments (chosen_targets being a no-op in live play, and the stack.peek() fragility) — applying them is optional but encouraged if it makes the card work correctly in live play without breaking tests. If you decline an advisory, that's fine.\n\nHARD RULE: Do NOT modify any test file. If you believe the strict comment is wrong, record it in disagreements.json (do not silently ignore).\n\nEngine scope: may add to engine/ and modify existing function bodies; must not rename/move/delete existing engine symbols; must not touch engine_tests/ or FDN tests.\n\nVerify: `pytest cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py` all pass; if you touched engine, also `pytest engine_tests/`.\n\nOutputs (CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1`):\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-revised.diff` — full updated diff.\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-revised-rationale.md` — what changed and why.\n- `$CARD_DIR/disagreements.json` — JSON array of `{\"review_comment_index\": <n>, \"reviewer_comment\": \"...\", \"implementer_justification\": \"...\"}` for any strict comment you did NOT apply. Empty array [] if you applied everything.\n- Update this card's entry in `FILES_MODIFIED.json` in place.\n\nReturn: REVISION_DONE with disagreement_count, diff_path, disagreements_path.","agentId":"af657d75c1d2d3483","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All done.\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/disagreements.json\n\nSummary of changes (all in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py`, no engine files touched):\n- Strict (index 0) applied: `get_targets()` now returns `[]` while the creature spell is on the stack (detected via new `_is_being_cast_as_creature()` which checks for `self` in any player's STACK zone), so casting The Dawning Archaic no longer forces a graveyard instant/sorcery target. The graveyard requirement is factored into `_graveyard_target_requirement()` and only advertised outside the creature-spell cast (which is exactly what the tests exercise).\n- Advisory (index 1) applied: free-cast target selection (`_select_free_cast_target`) honours pre-set `chosen_targets` first, otherwise actively asks `controller.choose_target(...)` so the ability isn't a no-op in live play.\n- Advisory (index 2) applied: replaced `stack.peek()` with a search over `game.stack.objects()` matching `source is target` to robustly locate the just-pushed free-cast spell before rewrapping `on_resolve` for the exile redirect.\n\nVerification: `pytest cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py` → 27 passed; `pytest engine_tests/` → 1145 passed. No test files were modified."}],"totalDurationMs":135503,"totalTokens":61159,"totalToolUseCount":26,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":144,"cache_read_input_tokens":60496,"output_tokens":517,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":144},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":517,"cache_read_input_tokens":60496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":144,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens