{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QNZUA7o3STRKGSwpabwgjd","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 18\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-files.txt\nuntestable_count: 3\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 18 tests for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares (creature properties, ETB Inkling token color/flying/P-T/target-player, conditional becomes-prepared, targeting + robustness); 13 fail in red phase, 5 negative/guard cases pass against the empty stub. Prepared keyword, copy-casting, and the Swords-to-Plowshares spell face are engine-unsupported and recorded as untestable.\n\nKey file paths (all absolute):\n- Test file: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py`\n- Rationale: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md`\n- Files list: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-files.txt`\n- Untestable: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/untestable.json`\n\nNote for the Implementer: the behavioral contract assumed by the tests is (a) the ETB effect is reachable via `on_resolve` (FDN-205 pattern) or a registered `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent` trigger; (b) the Inkling token exposes `colors`, `is_token`, `subtypes={\"Inkling\"}`, flying, and 1/1; (c) the conditional prepared state is exposed as an `is_prepared` bool; (d) `get_targets` returns `[]` while the card is in a STACK zone (per `KEY_DECISIONS.md` sos_1 convention). The `Prepared` keyword, copy-cast machinery, and the `Swords to Plowshares` instant face are recorded as untestable pending engine support."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aa0e0b29026d49a20 (use SendMessage with to: 'aa0e0b29026d49a20' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 66800\ntool_uses: 32\nduration_ms: 147892</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"0749e1dd-9967-414e-84b2-6