{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FxjuF8z7j7GbowJ275kmJR","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/game.py:353:def create_token(game: GameState, player: Player, token: Any) -> None:\n/workspace/engine/game.py-354-    \"\"\"Create a token on the battlefield under *player*'s control.\n/workspace/engine/game.py-355-\n/workspace/engine/game.py-356-    Sets ``is_token = True`` on the token, along with ``owner`` and\nengine/game.py-357-    ``controller``.  Uses :func:`move_to_zone` for entering-battlefield\n/workspace/engine/game.py-358-    hooks (trigger/replacement-effect registration and ETB event).\n/workspace/engine/game.py-359-\nengine/game.py-360-    Parameters:\nengine/game.py-361-        game: The current game state.\nengine/game.py-362-        player: The player who controls the token.\nengine/game.py-363-        token: The token object to place on the battlefield.\n/workspace/engine/game.py-364-    \"\"\"\n/workspace/engine/game.py-365-    token.is_token = True\n/workspace/engine/game.py-366-    token.owner = player\n/workspace/engine/game.py-367-    token.controller = player\n/workspace/engine/game.py-368-\n/workspace/engine/game.py-369-    # Tokens don't come from an existing zone — add directly and fire hooks.\nengine/game.py-370-    # Ordering matches move_to_zone: fire ETB *before* registering the token's\n/workspace/engine/game.py-371-    # own triggers so a token's ETB trigger doesn't self-fire on entry.\n/workspace/engine/game.py-372-    battlefield = game.get_battlefield(player)\n/workspace/engine/game.py-373-    battlefield.add(token)\n/workspace/engine/game.py-374-\n/workspace/engine/game.py-375-    game.trigger_manager.fire_event(\n/workspace/engine/game.py-376-        game,\n/workspace/engine/game.py-377-        EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent(permanent=token, controller=player),\n/workspace/engine/game.py-378-    )"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01F9yafmNtMYgjRqYhvsF8zA","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917