{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01D7f1hU9K16v1NAnWRtYZjK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QGNEZiZmaMHzitjgm5tWQc","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test rationale — sos_57 Mana Sculpt\n\nCard: **Mana Sculpt** — `{1}{U}{U}` Instant.\nOracle: \"Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C}\nequal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell at the beginning of your\nnext main phase.\"\n\nTest file: `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`\n\n## What each test covers\n\n### TestManaSculptProperties (static data)\n- `test_is_instant` / `test_card_type_includes_instant` — the card is an\n  `Instant` (so it can be cast at instant speed and goes to the graveyard on\n  resolve).\n- `test_name` — name matches the spec exactly.\n- `test_mana_cost` — cost parses to `{1}{U}{U}`.\n- `test_is_blue` — the cost has two blue pips and one generic (validates the\n  card's blue identity from the spec `colors: [\"U\"]`).\n\n### TestManaSculptTargeting (\"Counter target spell\")\n- `test_returns_single_target_requirement` — `get_targets()` advertises exactly\n  one `TargetRequirement` (a single target spell).\n- `test_target_zone_is_stack` — the target requirement's zone is `Zone.STACK`,\n  because a \"spell\" is an object on the stack (rule 112.1).\n- `test_filter_accepts_sorcery_spell` / `test_filter_accepts_instant_spell` —\n  the filter accepts spell objects.\n- `test_filter_rejects_non_spell` — a non-spell object (no spell card types) is\n  not a legal target.\n\n### TestManaSculptCounter (counter behavior)\n- `test_countered_spell_leaves_the_stack` — after Mana Sculpt resolves against a\n  chosen target spell, that spell's `StackObject` is gone from the stack and the\n  card is no longer in its controller's STACK zone.\n- `test_countered_spell_goes_to_owner_graveyard` — a countered spell is put into\n  its owner's graveyard (rule 701.5g / 608.2m).\n- `test_countered_spell_does_not_resolve_its_effect` — the countered spell's\n  `on_resolve` must not run (a marker subclass records whether it ran). Guards\n  against an implementation that lets the spell resolve.\n- `test_no_target_is_a_noop` — resolving with no chosen target neither raises\n  nor moves the (unrelated) spell off the stack.\n- `test_none_target_is_a_noop` — an explicit `[None]` target list is a no-op,\n  not a crash (defends against the \"target became illegal\" case).\n\n### TestManaSculptWizardGateDoesNotAffectCounter\n- `test_counters_even_without_a_wizard` — controlling a non-Wizard creature does\n  not suppress the counter; the spell is still countered.\n- `test_counters_when_controlling_a_wizard` — controlling a Wizard does not break\n  the counter; the spell is still countered.\n- These pin down that the conditional \"If you control a Wizard …\" clause governs\n  only the bonus `{C}` mana, never the counter itself.\n\n## Edge cases deliberately covered\n- No-target / `[None]`-target resolution (illegal/missing target) must be a safe\n  no-op.\n- Counter must move the spell to the **owner's** graveyard, not the caster's.\n- Counter must work irrespective of the Wizard condition.\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered here (see untestable.json)\nThe delayed bonus — \"If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C} equal to the\namount of mana spent to cast that spell at the beginning of your next main\nphase\" — cannot be asserted with the current engine surface:\n\n1. **No beginning-of-main-phase trigger event.** `engine/events.py` defines\n   upkeep/combat/end-step/end-of-turn triggered events but no main-phase event,\n   so a \"at the beginning of your next main phase\" delayed trigger has no event\n   to fire on and no observable hook to assert against.\n2. **The amount of mana spent to cast the countered spell is not recorded.**\n   The casting pipeline stores only `colors_spent` on a card; it never records\n   the total quantity of mana paid, and the `StackObject` carries no such field.\n   So \"amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent\" has no ground-truth\n   value the test could compare against.\n\nPer `KEY_DECISIONS.md`, no new `Keyword` enum member is needed for this card, so\nthat locked-count constraint is not implicated.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1350,"cache_read_input_tokens":96805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1350,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SJbUvcnfTXvMNc9n6DiuY5","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"69929d7b-43ff-4d74-8035-0c4f2adb7849","request_id":"req_011CbcGAaxHrCFiXreNXRMDB","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_57"}
