{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015jnAL4zaWBypLFWCtQqroq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"requirement\": \"add an amount of {C} ... at the beginning of your next main phase\",\n4\t    \"reason\": \"engine/events.py has no beginning-of-main-phase triggered event (only upkeep, begin-combat, end-step, end-of-turn). A delayed 'at the beginning of your next main phase' trigger has no event class to register against and no observable hook to fire, so the timing of the {C} mana cannot be asserted.\",\n5\t    \"what_would_unblock\": \"Add a BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent (or BeginningOfPrecombatMain/PostcombatMain) to engine/events.py and fire it from the turn/phase progression in engine/game_state.py or the turn loop, so a delayed trigger can be registered and observed.\"\n6\t  },\n7\t  {\n8\t    \"requirement\": \"add an amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell\",\n9\t    \"reason\": \"The casting pipeline (engine/casting.py) records only colors_spent on the cast card; it does not record the total quantity of mana paid to cast a spell, and StackObject carries no mana-spent field. There is no ground-truth 'amount of mana spent' to assert the produced {C} count against.\",\n10\t    \"what_would_unblock\": \"Record total mana paid for a cast (e.g. a `mana_spent` attribute set on the card / StackObject by player.mana_pool.pay in engine/casting.py), so a test can verify the {C} amount equals the mana spent on the countered spell.\"\n11\t  },\n12\t  {\n13\t    \"requirement\": \"If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C} ...\",\n14\t    \"reason\": \"The Wizard-gated bonus is only observable once the {C}-mana sub-clause is testable; with no main-phase event and no mana-spent tracking, the difference between controlling vs not controlling a Wizard cannot be asserted on the bonus itself. (The counter half is covered: it is independent of the Wizard condition.)\",\n15\t    \"what_would_unblock\": \"Both unblockers above (a main-phase trigger event and recorded mana-spent), after which a test can assert the {C} is added only when a Wizard is controlled.\"\n16\t  }\n17\t]\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018Kvfn4HqTQECn3S9uSoUJy","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"5bf963d8-3690-4a42-b615-89222572ccf9","timestamp":"2026-06-01T08:59:02.831Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_57"}
