   \"summary\": \"Together as One sorcery: Converge X=len(colors_spent), target player draws X, deal X to any target, controller gains X\"\n45\t        }\n46\t      ]\n47\t    }\n48\t  ]\n49\t}\n50\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018Kvfn4HqTQECn3S9uSoUJy","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"5625d803-7c2f-43ef-a3a9-4798a946acc3","timestamp":"2026-06-01T08:59:06.943Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_57"}
