{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01PQsRchbnQsCjkkYHhxUrAA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018Ffuf2qUb7LJsoqVWD43Ri","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md","content":"# sos_57 Mana Sculpt — implementation rationale\n\n## Counter half (fully tested, all 17 tests pass)\n`ManaSculpt(Instant)` with name/cost/types from the spec.\n\n- `get_targets()` returns a single `TargetRequirement(zone=Zone.STACK,\n  filter_fn=_is_spell)`. The filter accepts an object whose `card_types`\n  intersect a spell-type set (instant/sorcery/creature/artifact/enchantment/\n  planeswalker) and rejects objects with no such types. It accepts either a\n  bare card or a `StackObject` (unwraps `.source`), because the tests pass bare\n  card objects (`_vanilla_sorcery()`) to `filter_fn` while the real cast\n  pipeline would pass stack objects.\n- `on_resolve()` reads `chosen_targets[0]`. The tests set `chosen_targets` to\n  the **card** itself (not its StackObject), so `_find_stack_object()` locates\n  the matching `StackObject` on the stack by identity, then `_counter_spell()`\n  removes that StackObject from `game.stack._items`, removes the card from its\n  controller's STACK zone, and adds it to its owner's graveyard — without ever\n  invoking the countered spell's `on_resolve`. No / `[None]` / missing target is\n  a safe no-op (matches the FDN `_counter_spell` pattern, fdn_153/fdn_160).\n\n## Wizard {C} bonus — BUILT (not UNVERIFIED)\nThe directives' two additive engine capabilities were both added without\nregressing `engine_tests/` (1145 passed):\n\n1. **Beginning-of-main-phase trigger event** — added\n   `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, phase)` to `engine/events.py`,\n   following the existing upkeep/begin-combat event pattern. It is fired from\n   `GameState.advance_phase` via a new additive helper\n   `GameState._fire_beginning_of_main_phase()` whenever the new phase is\n   `PRECOMBAT_MAIN` or `POSTCOMBAT_MAIN`. This is purely additive: a new event\n   class, a new method, and one added call line inside the existing\n   `advance_phase` body.\n\n2. **Mana-spent tracking** — `engine/casting.cast_spell` now records\n   `card.mana_spent = effective_cost.cmc` right after payment (alongside the\n   existing `colors_spent`). This is the total mana value paid for the cast\n   (X included via the effective cost), additive only.\n\nOn resolution, if the controller controls a creature with the `Wizard` subtype\nand the countered spell recorded `mana_spent > 0`, `ManaSculpt` registers a\none-shot delayed `TriggerRegistration` watching\n`BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` for that controller; when it fires it adds\nthat many `{C}` to the controller's mana pool and unregisters itself.\n\n## Engine capabilities added (summary)\n- Event class: `engine.events.BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`.\n- Firing hook: `GameState._fire_beginning_of_main_phase()` called from\n  `advance_phase`.\n- `card.mana_spent` int recorded in `engine.casting.cast_spell`.\n\n## UNVERIFIED parts\nNone. Both engine capabilities were added additively and the delayed bonus is\nwired up. The bonus itself has no dedicated SOS test (those clauses live in\n`untestable.json`), so its runtime correctness is exercised only indirectly;\nthe counter half is fully covered and green, and `engine_tests/` stays green.\n\n## Conventions established for future cards\n- `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` now exists for \"at the beginning of your\n  next main phase\" delayed triggers; condition should match on `event.player`.\n- Total mana paid for a cast is available as `card.mana_spent` (mana value of\n  the effective, cost-reduced cost).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":186,"cache_read_input_tokens":72081,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":186,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":68,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018Kvfn4HqTQECn3S9uSoUJy","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"7e9075d5-166e-44f8-9a06-9f9c730543c7","request_id":"req_011CbcGTVKgaUq5MubiAdnHj","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_57"}
