:\"sos_57\",\"tests\":[...],\"implementation\":[...]}\n\nReturn IMPL_DONE (files_changed, tests_passing, diff_path, rationale_path, notes — and state whether the delayed {C} bonus was BUILT or left UNVERIFIED) or DISPUTE.","agentId":"ab20f31c0849a127a","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"IMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: 4\ntests_passing: all (17/17 sos_57; engine_tests/ green at 1145 passed; 1162 combined)\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: Counter half fully implemented and tested. The delayed Wizard {C} bonus was BUILT (not left UNVERIFIED): added additive `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` to `engine/events.py`, fired it from `GameState.advance_phase` via a new `_fire_beginning_of_main_phase()` helper, and recorded `card.mana_spent` (effective cost mana value) in `engine/casting.py`. On resolution, if the controller controls a Wizard and `mana_spent > 0`, a one-shot delayed trigger adds that many {C} at the controller's next main phase. All engine changes are additive only and `engine_tests/` stays green.\n\nFiles changed: `cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/game_state.py`, `engine/casting.py`. FILES_MODIFIED.json upserted for `sos_57` (jq was unavailable in this environment, so the documented jq-equivalent upsert was performed in Python)."}],"totalDurationMs":170465,"totalTokens":75843,"totalToolUseCount":42,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":197,"cache_read_input_tokens":75181,"output_tokens":463,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":197},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":463,"cache_read_input_tokens":75181,"cache_creation_input_tokens":197,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":197,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],