use still genuinely cannot be tested, leave a note — but the rationale says the support is complete, so aim for full coverage.\n\nOutput:\n- Update `$CARD_DIR/untestable.json`: remove entries now covered; if empty, write `[]` or delete it.\n- Append to `$CARD_DIR/test-rationale.md` describing the added tests.\n- Keep `$CARD_DIR/test-files.txt` listing `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`.\n\nReturn a short status: number of tests added, total tests, whether the full file passes, remaining untestable_count."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015rJSnz1LezCJNzSZuKfbai","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"ca624031-4be9-46ab-a67f-ea0dba219e65","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:02:05.665Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend sos_57 tests for C bonus"}
