{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Xchf6wN7JWBGqiRPTovEG","type":"tool_result","content":"        # Walk through the beginning-phase steps (untap/upkeep/draw); none of\n        # these is a main phase, so the pool must remain empty throughout.\n        for _ in range(3):\n            _advance_one_phase_resolving(game)\n            if game.phase in (Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN, Phase.POSTCOMBAT_MAIN):\n                break\n            assert caster.mana_pool.get(ManaType.COLORLESS) == 0\n    \n        # Finish reaching the main phase; the {C} is delivered exactly then.\n        _advance_to_next_main_phase(game, caster)\n>       assert caster.mana_pool.get(ManaType.COLORLESS) == spell.mana_spent\nE       AssertionError: assert 0 == 4\nE        +  where 0 = get(<ManaType.COLORLESS: 'C'>)\nE        +    where get = ManaPool({}).get\nE        +      where ManaPool({}) = <engine.player.DeterministicPlayer object at 0x7dd7b1714590>.mana_pool\nE        +    and   <ManaType.COLORLESS: 'C'> = ManaType.COLORLESS\nE        +  and   4 = <engine.card.Sorcery object at 0x7dd7b17156d0>.mana_spent\n\ncards/sos/sos_57/tests.py:426: AssertionError\n=============================== warnings summary ===============================\n../usr/local/lib/python3.11/dist-packages/_pytest/config/__init__.py:1434\n  /usr/local/lib/python3.11/dist-packages/_pytest/config/__init__.py:1434: PytestConfigWarning: Unknown config option: timeout\n  \n    self._warn_or_fail_if_strict(f\"Unknown config option: {key}\\n\")\n\n-- Docs: https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/capture-warnings.html\n=========================== short test summary info ============================\nFAILED cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py::TestManaSculptWizardManaBonus::test_bonus_not_delivered_before_main_phase\n1 failed, 22 passed, 1 warning in 0.05s","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015rJSnz1LezCJNzSZuKfbai","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"52592354-a9ae-