{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_017xqLTq5MeoqG1v6eLZKfok","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01H61zecn769jRrrzjGp237v","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md","old_string":"Per `KEY_DECISIONS.md`, no new `Keyword` enum member is needed for this card, so\nthat locked-count constraint is not implicated.","new_string":"Per `KEY_DECISIONS.md`, no new `Keyword` enum member is needed for this card, so\nthat locked-count constraint is not implicated.\n\n## Update — Wizard {C} bonus now covered (engine support added)\n\nThe Implementer added additive engine support that makes the previously\nuntestable delayed bonus observable:\n\n* `engine.events.BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`, fired from\n  `GameState.advance_phase` via `_fire_beginning_of_main_phase()`.\n* `card.mana_spent`, the total mana paid for a cast, recorded in\n  `engine.casting.cast_spell`.\n\nA new test class `TestManaSculptWizardManaBonus` in\n`cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` now covers all three formerly-untestable clauses.\nThe harness stages the opponent's spell on the stack with an explicit\n`mana_spent` (the casting pipeline would set this for real), resolves Mana\nSculpt to counter it, then drives `game.advance_phase()` step by step —\nresolving the StackObject that the `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` pushes —\nto observe the delayed `{C}`.  (`advance_phase` empties mana pools *before* the\ndelayed trigger resolves, so the `{C}` added by the resolving trigger survives\ninto the new main phase.)\n\nNew test cases:\n\n- `test_wizard_grants_colorless_at_next_main_phase` — with a Wizard, the pool is\n  empty right after the counter and gains `{C}` once the controller's next main\n  phase begins. Validates \"If you control a Wizard, add … {C} … at the\n  beginning of your next main phase.\"\n- `test_bonus_amount_equals_mana_spent_on_countered_spell` — a spell whose\n  `mana_spent` is 8 yields exactly 8 `{C}`. Validates \"an amount of {C} equal to\n  the amount of mana spent to cast that spell.\"\n- `test_no_wizard_grants_no_colorless` — without a Wizard, no delayed trigger is\n  registered and no `{C}` is ever added. Validates the Wizard gate on the bonus.\n- `test_bonus_not_delivered_before_main_phase` — stepping through the beginning\n  phase (untap/upkeep/draw), the pool stays empty until the main phase, where\n  the `{C}` appears. Validates the \"at the beginning of your **next main\n  phase**\" timing (not before).\n- `test_bonus_is_independent_of_the_counter` — the counter resolves immediately\n  (spell in the opponent's graveyard) while the `{C}` is still pending, and both\n  hold after the main phase. Validates that the bonus and the counter half are\n  independent.\n- `test_zero_mana_spent_grants_no_colorless` — a countered spell with\n  `mana_spent == 0` yields no `{C}` even with a Wizard (the impl only registers\n  the bonus when `mana_spent > 0`).\n\nAll 23 tests in the file pass against the current implementation\n(`pytest cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` → 23 passed). `untestable.json` is now `[]`."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":95,"cache_read_input_tokens":66953,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":95,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015rJSnz1LezCJNzSZuKfbai","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"f4423f31-0d3f-4ee7-8f8a-2c4fdf299e68","request_id":"req_011CbcGmfaaGBLStPKWM5Mma","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend sos_57 tests for C bonus"}
