{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015rJSnz1LezCJNzSZuKfbai","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 23\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-files.txt\nnotes: Added 6 tests (new class TestManaSculptWizardManaBonus) covering the previously-untestable Wizard {C} bonus; 23 total, full file passes; untestable_count now 0\n\nSummary:\n- Added 6 new tests in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` (class `TestManaSculptWizardManaBonus`); all 17 original tests left unchanged.\n- Total tests: 23. Full file passes (`pytest cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` → 23 passed).\n- Remaining untestable_count: 0 — `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/untestable.json` is now `[]`.\n\nThe new tests cover every previously-untestable clause:\n- Wizard controlled → controller gains {C} at the beginning of its next main phase (not before).\n- No Wizard → no delayed trigger registered and no {C} added.\n- {C} amount equals the countered spell's recorded `mana_spent` (verified with two distinct values, 4 and 8, plus a 0 edge case).\n- Bonus is independent of the counter (spell is countered immediately to the opponent's graveyard while the {C} stays pending until the next main phase).\n\nKey mechanism note exercised by the helpers: `GameState.advance_phase` fires `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` and pushes the delayed trigger as a StackObject, then empties mana pools; the tests resolve the stack after each advance, so the {C} added by the resolving trigger survives into the new main phase. The caster is player 0 (active by default), so the bonus lands on its own next main phase.\n\nOutput files updated: `untestable.json` (now `[]`), `test-rationale.md` (appended an \"Update\" section describing the 6 new tests), `test-files.txt` (unchanged, already lists `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`)."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a3680cfc1fc4e5129 (use S