{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Um2fPsqJ5WALztNU1xs4f6","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review complete. I verified the counter half (follows the FDN_160 convention: removes the StackObject, removes from controller's STACK zone, adds to owner's graveyard, never runs `on_resolve`), the delayed bonus correctness, and confirmed the engine changes are strictly additive with no regression risk.\n\nKey engine-additivity verification: the new `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` is inserted between existing event classes with no renames/moves; `_fire_beginning_of_main_phase` is a new method called once in `advance_phase`; firing only pushes a StackObject (it does not resolve immediately), so the subsequent `empty_mana_pools()` does not wipe the bonus {C} — that mana is added later during stack resolution within the main phase, matching the spec. `card.mana_spent = effective_cost.cmc` is a single additive assignment alongside `colors_spent` and does not interfere with casting. No strict findings.\n\nRelevant file: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/review.json`\n\nREVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: 0\nadvisory_count: 2\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/review.json"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: adfbb046dde114aae (use SendMessage with to: 'adfbb046dde114aae' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 42162\ntool_uses: 27\nduration_ms: 124939</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"9090928d-d8b1-4008-a7d9-b38b9c00fa56","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:08:10.858Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Review the implementation diff for SOS card `sos_57` (Mana Sculpt — a counterspell with a Wizard-gated delayed {C} mana bonus). CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57`.\n\nDiff to review: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff` (includes BOTH card and engine changes).\nCard spec for intent: `cards/sos/sos_57/card_spec.json`.\nImplementer's rationale: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md`.\nContext: `FILES_MODIFIED.json`, `KEY_DECISIONS.md`.\n\nThis card required ADDITIVE engine changes (coordinator-approved): a new `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` in `engine/events.py` fired from `GameState.advance_phase`, and `card.mana_spent` tracking in `engine/casting.py`. These additions ARE in scope.\n\nReview focus:\n- Counter correctness: countered spell removed from stack, card to OWNER's graveyard, on_resolve not run.\n- Delayed bonus correctness: {C} == mana spent on countered spell, only if controller controls a Wizard, delivered at controller's NEXT main phase, one-shot (doesn't repeat).\n- ENGINE ADDITIVITY (important): verify the engine changes are strictly additive — no existing engine symbol renamed/moved/deleted, and the new main-phase event firing in advance_phase does not alter existing phase behavior in a way that could break other cards (e.g. firing at wrong time, double-firing, or changing mana-pool emptying order). Flag STRICT if you see a regression risk to existing engine behavior.\n- mana_spent tracking: ensure it doesn't interfere with existing casting logic.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do NOT flag conventions in KEY_DECISIONS.md.\n- Do NOT demand test rewrites — advisory only for test issues.\n- Only flag what's visible in the diff.\n\nOutput: write `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/review.json` as a JSON array of {\"severity\":\"strict\"|\"advisory\",\"file\",\"line\",\"comment\"}. \"strict\" only for correctness/spec/regression bugs that must be fixed. Empty [] if none.\n\nReturn: REVIEW_DONE with strict_count, advisory_count, review_path.","agentId":"adfbb046dde114aae","agentType":"Reviewer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review complete. I verified the counter half (follows the FDN_160 convention: removes the StackObject, removes from controller's STACK zone, adds to owner's graveyard, never runs `on_resolve`), the delayed bonus correctness, and confirmed the engine changes are strictly additive with no regression risk.\n\nKey engine-additivity verification: the new `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` is inserted between existing event classes with no renames/moves; `_fire_beginning_of_main_phase` is a new method called once in `advance_phase`; firing only pushes a StackObject (it does not resolve immediately), so the subsequent `empty_mana_pools()` does not wipe the bonus {C} — that mana is added later during stack resolution within the main phase, matching the spec. `card.mana_spent = effective_cost.cmc` is a single additive assignment alongside `colors_spent` and does not interfere with casting. No strict findings.\n\nRelevant file: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/review.json`\n\nREVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: 0\nadvisory_count: 2\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/review.json"}],"totalDurationMs":124939,"totalTokens":42162,"totalToolUseCount":27,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1294,"cache_read_input_tokens":40468,"output_tokens":398,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1294},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":40468,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1294,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1294,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":16,"searchCount":8,"bashCount":2,"editFileCount":1,"linesAdded":15,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
