nts.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/zones.py`, `engine/game_state.py`, `engine/player.py`. `RULEBOOK.txt` (grep) for planeswalker / coin-flip / skip-turn rules.\n\nVerify: `pytest cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py` all pass; AND `pytest engine_tests/` stays green.\n\nOutputs:\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl.diff` (full diff via `git diff > $CARD_DIR/impl.diff`).\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-rationale.md` — approach; LIST which engine capabilities you added (coin-flip helper, skipped_turns) and which parts (if any) you left UNVERIFIED and why.\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-files.txt` — files changed.\n- Upsert this card's entry in `FILES_MODIFIED.json` (root). Match by `card: \"sos_97\"`.\n\nReturn IMPL_DONE (files_changed, tests_passing, diff_path, rationale_path, notes — state whether coin-flip and turn-skip were BUILT or UNVERIFIED) or DISPUTE."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":79638,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1210},"output_tokens":59,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"1dc2d62b-f4bf-422b-8633-1917370cb30e","request_id":"req_011CbcHmxBa6xyg7FAPjDCYz"}
