AND `pytest engine_tests/` stays green.\n\nOutputs:\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl.diff` (full diff via `git diff > $CARD_DIR/impl.diff`).\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-rationale.md` — approach; LIST which engine capabilities you added (coin-flip helper, skipped_turns) and which parts (if any) you left UNVERIFIED and why.\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-files.txt` — files changed.\n- Upsert this card's entry in `FILES_MODIFIED.json` (root). Match by `card: \"sos_97\"`.\n\nReturn IMPL_DONE (files_changed, tests_passing, diff_path, rationale_path, notes — state whether coin-flip and turn-skip were BUILT or UNVERIFIED) or DISPUTE."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EVQk5wqb73SzprdJXKMZAu","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"9349d4cb-7053-4c2c-9326-d6c1e31de74e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:18:34.751Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_97"}
