{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UumXJUJw93ejA2gnrdyZs9","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_REWRITTEN\n\n- tests_added: 6 (all in `TestRalUltimate`)\n- total_tests: 30 (24 original + 6 new), all passing\n- full_file_passes: yes — `pytest cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py` -> 30 passed\n- untestable_count: 0 (`untestable.json` is now `[]`)\n\nNew ultimate (−7) tests added to `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py`:\n- `test_ultimate_forced_head_count_sets_skipped_turns` — forces 3 heads/2 tails via the controller's coin-flip script -> X==3 -> opponent `skipped_turns` becomes exactly 3.\n- `test_ultimate_all_tails_skips_no_turns` — five tails -> X==0 -> no skip.\n- `test_ultimate_all_heads_skips_five_turns` — five heads -> X==5 -> opponent `skipped_turns` increases by 5.\n- `test_ultimate_adds_to_existing_skipped_turns` — confirms `+=` (adds X, doesn't overwrite).\n- `test_skipped_turn_is_consumed_by_turn_rotation` — drives the live turn loop (`advance_to_phase` ENDING/CLEANUP + `advance_phase`) through the end-of-turn wrap; asserts the skip is consumed (`skipped_turns` -> 0) and the opponent does NOT become active (turn handed back to controller).\n- `test_zero_heads_leaves_turn_rotation_unchanged` — control case confirming the skip hook is a no-op when X==0 (opponent becomes active normally).\n\nThe coin flips are driven deterministically by extending the controller `p1._script` (read by `GameState.flip_coin` via `choose_yes_no`); turn skipping is observed through `Player.skipped_turns` and the live `advance_phase` rotation.\n\nOutput files updated:\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/untestable.json` -> `[]`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-rationale.md` -> appended an \"Update — ultimate now fully covered\" section\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-files.txt` -> unchanged (still lists `cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py`)"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a48c4625ed3f18870 (use SendMessage with to: 'a48c4625ed3f18870' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 49786\ntool_uses: 21\nduration_ms: 102663</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"bf42ce23-8376-4f87-8316-7018f0a25640","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:24:21.927Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Extend the test suite for SOS card `sos_97` (Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer). CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97`.\n\nCONTEXT: When you first wrote tests, the -7 ultimate's coin-flip count (X) and turn-skipping were UNTESTABLE (`$CARD_DIR/untestable.json`). The Implementer has now BUILT additive engine support. Read `$CARD_DIR/impl-rationale.md` for specifics:\n- `GameState.flip_coin(player)` — a deterministic coin flip scriptable via DeterministicPlayer's `choose_yes_no` (so a test can force a known number of heads).\n- `Player.skipped_turns` — a per-player counter, consumed by a new `_apply_skipped_turns()` hook in `GameState.advance_phase` (default 0 = no-op).\n- The -7 ultimate flips five coins, computes X = heads, and does `target.skipped_turns += X`.\n\nYOUR TASK: ADD new tests to `cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py` covering the previously-untestable ultimate. Do NOT remove or alter existing passing tests. Cover at least:\n- Forcing a known number of heads (via the DeterministicPlayer script for the coin flips) → X equals that count; the target opponent's `skipped_turns` increases by X.\n- An all-tails case (X=0) → no turns skipped.\n- An all-heads case (X=5) → opponent's skipped_turns increases by 5.\n- That the skip actually consumes the opponent's turns through the turn loop / advance_phase (observe skipped_turns decrement or turns being skipped), if feasible with test_utils.\n\nRead the engine source you need (`engine/game_state.py`, `engine/player.py`, `engine/turn.py`) and `test_utils.py`/`test_utils.md` to drive coin flips deterministically and advance turns. Follow existing test conventions in the file.\n\nThese new tests should PASS against the current implementation. Run `pytest cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py` and confirm ALL tests pass. If a sub-clause still genuinely can't be tested, leave a note, but aim for full coverage.\n\nOutput:\n- Update `$CARD_DIR/untestable.json`: remove entries now covered; write `[]` if empty.\n- Append to `$CARD_DIR/test-rationale.md` describing the added tests.\n- Keep `$CARD_DIR/test-files.txt` listing `cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py`.\n\nReturn a short status: tests added, total tests, whether the full file passes, remaining untestable_count.","agentId":"a48c4625ed3f18870","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_REWRITTEN\n\n- tests_added: 6 (all in `TestRalUltimate`)\n- total_tests: 30 (24 original + 6 new), all passing\n- full_file_passes: yes — `pytest cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py` -> 30 passed\n- untestable_count: 0 (`untestable.json` is now `[]`)\n\nNew ultimate (−7) tests added to `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py`:\n- `test_ultimate_forced_head_count_sets_skipped_turns` — forces 3 heads/2 tails via the controller's coin-flip script -> X==3 -> opponent `skipped_turns` becomes exactly 3.\n- `test_ultimate_all_tails_skips_no_turns` — five tails -> X==0 -> no skip.\n- `test_ultimate_all_heads_skips_five_turns` — five heads -> X==5 -> opponent `skipped_turns` increases by 5.\n- `test_ultimate_adds_to_existing_skipped_turns` — confirms `+=` (adds X, doesn't overwrite).\n- `test_skipped_turn_is_consumed_by_turn_rotation` — drives the live turn loop (`advance_to_phase` ENDING/CLEANUP + `advance_phase`) through the end-of-turn wrap; asserts the skip is consumed (`skipped_turns` -> 0) and the opponent does NOT become active (turn handed back to controller).\n- `test_zero_heads_leaves_turn_rotation_unchanged` — control case confirming the skip hook is a no-op when X==0 (opponent becomes active normally).\n\nThe coin flips are driven deterministically by extending the controller `p1._script` (read by `GameState.flip_coin` via `choose_yes_no`); turn skipping is observed through `Player.skipped_turns` and the live `advance_phase` rotation.\n\nOutput files updated:\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/untestable.json` -> `[]`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-rationale.md` -> appended an \"Update — ultimate now fully covered\" section\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-files.txt` -> unchanged (still lists `cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py`)"}],"totalDurationMs":102663,"totalTokens":49786,"totalToolUseCount":21,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":260,"cache_read_input_tokens":48736,"output_tokens":788,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":260},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":788,"cache_read_input_tokens":48736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":260,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":260,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":10,"searchCount":3,"bashCount":3,"editFileCount":5,"linesAdded":182,"linesRemoved":31,"otherToolCount":0}}}
