{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LSxHUE1CJP5vz8AYKCH8mo","type":"tool_result","content":"152:        generic: The generic (numerical) component of the cost.\n153:        pips: Mapping of colored/colorless mana pips to their counts.\n158:    generic: int = 0\n159:    pips: dict[ManaType, int] = field(default_factory=dict)\n164:    def cmc(self) -> int:\n169:        return self.generic + sum(self.pips.values()) + len(self.hybrid)\n175:        Supports generic mana (``{N}``), colored pips (``{W}``, ``{U}``, ``{B}``,\n176:        ``{R}``, ``{G}``), colorless pips (``{C}``), and X costs (``{X}``).\n195:        generic = 0\n196:        pips: dict[ManaType, int] = {}\n206:                pips[mana_type] = pips.get(mana_type, 0) + 1\n222:                    # Try to parse as a number (generic mana)\n231:                            f\"Negative generic mana {token!r} in cost string {cost_str!r}\"\n233:                    generic += value\n235:        return cls(generic=generic, pips=pips, x_count=x_count, hybrid=hybrid)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SxvYN2dGPf9aQaeBMJvQKB","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"8a88ebe5-350b-4cff-83c8-1009bfc07ab5","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:30:59.805Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_120"}
