{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01N5wPdbCNbN53T3JSiV4nre","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MQ9WtB52z8ie2bEdpCh4JE","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-rationale.md","content":"# sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone — implementation rationale\n\n## Approach\n`ImprovisationCapstone` subclasses `engine.card.Sorcery` (gives `CardType.SORCERY`),\nsets name, `{5}{R}{R}` cost, and the `Lesson` subtype in `__init__`.\n\n`on_resolve(game)` does two things:\n\n1. **Exile-until-total-MV-4** (`_exile_until_total_four`): loop exiling the top card\n   of the controller's library (`library.top(1)[-1]` — top is the last internal-list\n   element) and accumulating mana value via `mana_cost.cmc`, stopping as soon as the\n   running total reaches 4 or the library empties. The card crossing the threshold is\n   exiled and then the loop stops, so it never over-exiles. Empty/small libraries are\n   no-ops that never raise.\n2. **Free-cast among the exiled** (`_free_cast_among`): a \"may cast any number\" loop.\n   Each pass recomputes castable candidates (instants/sorceries still in exile), asks\n   the controller via `choose_yes_no` whether to cast another, then `choose_card` for\n   which, and casts it with `engine.casting.cast_spell_free(..., Zone.EXILE)` (the\n   sos_1 free-cast-from-zone pattern). Declining, an exhausted script, or any casting\n   exception ends the loop cleanly so resolution never raises. Lands/creatures are not\n   offered (`_is_castable_spell` restricts to instant/sorcery), satisfying the\n   \"no spells to cast\" test.\n\nThe test scripts the free cast as `appendleft(spell)` then `appendleft(True)`, i.e.\npop order = `True` (the yes/no) then `spell` (the choice), which matches the\n`choose_yes_no` → `choose_card` sequence.\n\n## Engine changes\nNone. The in-scope core is fully implementable within the card using existing\nhelpers (`get_library`, `get_exile`, `game.exile`, `cast_spell_free`,\n`ZoneContainer.top`). `pytest engine_tests/` stays green (1145 passed).\n\n## UNVERIFIED\nThe **Paradigm** clause (\"Then exile this spell. After you first resolve a spell with\nthis name, you may cast a copy of it from exile without paying its mana cost at the\nbeginning of each of your first main phases.\") is NOT implemented. Per coordinator\ndirectives and KEY_DECISIONS.md:\n- \"Paradigm\" cannot be a `Keyword` enum member (enum frozen at 16 members).\n- The recurring copy-from-exile delayed trigger has no engine surface (same gap marked\n  UNVERIFIED for sos_13's copy-cast); building a generic copy-from-exile system is out\n  of scope.\n\nA grep-able `# UNVERIFIED:` marker is placed in `on_resolve` documenting the omission.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":229,"cache_read_input_tokens":37196,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":229,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":68,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SxvYN2dGPf9aQaeBMJvQKB","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"6a68f33a-d39f-45d7-8575-b4ae40ef2273","request_id":"req_011CbcJoaaEHyjkyCiGD4UfU","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_120"}
