{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01AmRreHcxgUowAGUWxQTpvu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X8XHHB8E6P71Q4BA7Mpn6N","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-rationale.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2341,"cache_read_input_tokens":8113,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2341,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017AGMNzioYKWCAQpAoWPvcJ","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"d4bbbf44-19ba-471b-b03e-34d5f188485f","request_id":"req_011CbcJsw87TFH9yrgyXenEA","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_120"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X8XHHB8E6P71Q4BA7Mpn6N","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone — implementation rationale\n2\t\n3\t## Approach\n4\t`ImprovisationCapstone` subclasses `engine.card.Sorcery` (gives `CardType.SORCERY`),\n5\tsets name, `{5}{R}{R}` cost, and the `Lesson` subtype in `__init__`.\n6\t\n7\t`on_resolve(game)` does two things:\n8\t\n9\t1. **Exile-until-total-MV-4** (`_exile_until_total_four`): loop exiling the top card\n10\t   of the controller's library (`library.top(1)[-1]` — top is the last internal-list\n11\t   element) and accumulating mana value via `mana_cost.cmc`, stopping as soon as the\n12\t   running total reaches 4 or the library empties. The card crossing the threshold is\n13\t   exiled and then the loop stops, so it never over-exiles. Empty/small libraries are\n14\t   no-ops that never raise.\n15\t2. **Free-cast among the exiled** (`_free_cast_among`): a \"may cast any number\" loop.\n16\t   Each pass recomputes castable candidates (instants/sorceries still in exile), asks\n17\t   the controller via `choose_yes_no` whether to cast another, then `choose_card` for\n18\t   which, and casts it with `engine.casting.cast_spell_free(..., Zone.EXILE)` (the\n19\t   sos_1 free-cast-from-zone pattern). Declining, an exhausted script, or any casting\n20\t   exception ends the loop cleanly so resolution never raises. Lands/creatures are not\n21\t   offered (`_is_castable_spell` restricts to instant/sorcery), satisfying the\n22\t   \"no spells to cast\" test.\n23\t\n24\tThe test scripts the free cast as `appendleft(spell)` then `appendleft(True)`, i.e.\n25\tpop order = `True` (the yes/no) then `spell` (the choice), which matches the\n26\t`choose_yes_no` → `choose_card` sequence.\n27\t\n28\t## Engine changes\n29\tNone. The in-scope core is fully implementable within the card using existing\n30\thelpers (`get_library`, `get_exile`, `game.exile`, `cast_spell_free`,\n31\t`ZoneContainer.top`). `pytest engine_tests/` stays green (1145 passed).\n32\t\n33\t## UNVERIFIED\n34\tThe **Paradigm** clause (\"Then exile this spell. After you first resolve a spell with\n35\tthis name, you may cast a copy of it from exile without paying its mana cost at the\n36\tbeginning of each of your first main phases.\") is NOT implemented. Per coordinator\n37\tdirectives and KEY_DECISIONS.md:\n38\t- \"Paradigm\" cannot be a `Keyword` enum member (enum frozen at 16 members).\n39\t- The recurring copy-from-exile delayed trigger has no engine surface (same gap marked\n40\t  UNVERIFIED for sos_13's copy-cast); building a generic copy-from-exile system is out\n41\t  of scope.\n42\t\n43\tA grep-able `# UNVERIFIED:` marker is placed in `on_resolve` documenting the omission.\n44\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017AGMNzioYKWCAQpAoWPvcJ","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"3007b462-26ba-4290-80ca-37f2a703b61e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:32:54.059Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_120"}
