{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2QVdYNu5qLZSfJ9AxDwyB","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/types.py:148:class ManaCost:\nengine/types.py:164:    def cmc(self) -> int:\nengine/types.py:169:        return self.generic + sum(self.pips.values()) + len(self.hybrid)\nengine/types.py:172:    def parse(cls, cost_str: str) -> ManaCost:\nengine/casting.py:229:    card.colors_spent = list(player.mana_pool.last_payment_colors)  # type: ignore[attr-defined]\nengine/mana.py:26:        self._last_payment_colors: list[Color] = []\nengine/mana.py:57:    def last_payment_colors(self) -> list[Color]:\nengine/mana.py:64:        return list(self._last_payment_colors)\nengine/mana.py:70:    def can_pay(self, cost: ManaCost) -> bool:\nengine/mana.py:98:    def pay(self, cost: ManaCost, choices: dict[ManaType, int] | None = None) -> bool:\nengine/mana.py:162:        self._last_payment_colors = sorted(colors_spent, key=lambda c: c.value)\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:14:| `mana.py` | 200+ | `ManaPool` class — add/empty/total/get/can_pay/pay methods. Auto-pay generic costs preferring colorless mana. Backtracking hybrid mana symbol resolution in `can_pay()`/`pay()`. `last_payment_colors` property and `_MANA_TO_COLOR` mapping for Converge mechanic support. |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EsetUBrXacwixHmPHKwsvR","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"8e809fda-5c09-455c-b07c-2dbcaa347012","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:39:20.797Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_201"}
