{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"adcc410fede42ab9a","tool_use_id":"toolu_0138E7VkeFj65rLGAvBcgNVS","description":"Editing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Tester","usage":{"total_tokens":60069,"tool_uses":28,"duration_ms":123561},"last_tool_name":"Edit","uuid":"051b7d3e-ede1-4c8e-9b63-57d31ff71081","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_0149JU6nRJyYqCDdcfyDCK2f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J5JJzmqc5e77Nzthd3Bi7p","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md","old_string":"## Edge cases intentionally NOT covered\n- **Miracle \"cast when you drew it, first card this turn\" timing** — there is no\n  engine surface for the miracle draw/reveal/alternative-cast window\n  (`cards_drawn_this_turn` exists on the player but no miracle cast pipeline or\n  draw-window hook). Recorded in `untestable.json`.\n- **Flying combat restriction**","new_string":"### `TestLoreholdMiracleDrawWindow` — dynamic miracle (ADDED after engine support)\nThe dynamic half of miracle — \"(You may cast a card for its miracle cost when\nyou draw it if it's the first card you drew this turn.)\" — was originally\nuntestable (no draw-window / alternative-cast pipeline). The Implementer added\nadditive engine support: `GameState.register_miracle_grant` /\n`fire_miracle_window`, an `engine.casting.cast_spell_alternative` entry point,\nand a first-draw hook in `engine.game.draw_card`. Lorehold registers its grant\nfrom `register_triggers` (returns `{2}` only for the controller's first-drawn\ninstant/sorcery while Lorehold is on the battlefield).\n\nThese tests drive `engine.game.draw_card` directly, seed the controller's pool\nwith 2 generic mana (so the {2} miracle can actually be paid), and script the\n`choose_yes_no` answer. They assert observable outcomes (spell on stack / in\nhand / in graveyard, mana spent) rather than internals.\n- `test_first_drawn_instant_offered_miracle_cast_for_two` — an instant drawn as\n  the first card of the turn under Lorehold, when accepted, leaves the hand and\n  is cast as a spell on the stack; the {2} is paid from pool.\n- `test_first_drawn_sorcery_offered_miracle_cast_for_two` — same for a sorcery\n  (the grant covers both instants and sorceries).\n- `test_miracle_cast_resolves_to_graveyard` — the miracle-cast instant resolves\n  normally and ends up in the graveyard, confirming a real cast (not a stash).\n- `test_declining_keeps_first_drawn_spell_in_hand` — \"you MAY cast\": declining\n  (scripted `False`) leaves the drawn instant uncast in hand and costs no mana.\n- `test_second_draw_same_turn_gets_no_miracle_window` — with\n  `cards_drawn_this_turn` already 1, a subsequent draw fires no window (the\n  spell stays in hand, stack empty, no mana spent, no yes/no consumed). Edge\n  case: \"first card you drew this turn\".\n- `test_first_drawn_creature_gets_no_miracle_window` — a first-drawn creature\n  gets no window (grant is instant/sorcery-only). Edge case: type restriction.\n- `test_no_lorehold_means_no_miracle_window` — with no Lorehold on the\n  battlefield (no grant registered), drawing a first-card instant fires no\n  window. Edge case: the grant is the only source of the window.\n\n## Edge cases intentionally NOT covered\n- **Flying combat restriction**"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2358,"cache_read_input_tokens":57206,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2358,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0138E7VkeFj65rLGAvBcgNVS","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"3fd531b5-c0a3-4ae6-9d63-8760645b02f6","request_id":"req_011CbcKkUSRR6wzWCg9JYeuV","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend sos_201 tests for miracle"}
