e diff.\n\nOutput: write `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/review.json` as a JSON array of {\"severity\":\"strict\"|\"advisory\",\"file\",\"line\",\"comment\"}. \"strict\" only for correctness/spec/regression bugs that must be fixed. Empty [] if none.\n\nReturn: REVIEW_DONE with strict_count, advisory_count, review_path."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PzUQHDyTL3F6xPfuQoCZ2o","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"8b57f084-0a04-4cc9-bcc8-3bef1557f12c","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:45:00.202Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_201"}
