{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015YjqSJ8qf6KKiKFJ4NXToW","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 23\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/test-files.txt\nuntestable_count: 1\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 23 test cases for sos_226 Silverquill, the Disputant (static W/B 4/4 Flying/Vigilance Elder Dragon + casualty 1 grant: scope, sacrifice-power-1 legality, sacrifice+copy+new-targets); all fail against the stub (TDD red). 1 untestable: the \"as you cast\" casualty pipeline integration has no engine hook.\n\nKey file paths (absolute):\n- Tests: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py`\n- Rationale: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/test-rationale.md`\n- Files list: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/test-files.txt`\n- Untestable: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/untestable.json`\n\nContract the Implementer must satisfy (helper API the tests assert against): `card.casualty_value == 1`; `card.grants_casualty_to(game, spell) -> bool` (your instants/sorceries only); `card.is_valid_casualty_sacrifice(creature) -> bool` (creature with power >= 1); `card.apply_casualty(game, spell_stack_object, sacrifice_creature, new_targets=None)` (sacrifices the creature and pushes one copy of the spell on the stack, controlled by the caster, carrying new targets when supplied — the engine's `engine.stack.copy_spell` and `engine.game.sacrifice` are available to build it)."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a13835a1b59d9d21c (use SendMessage with to: 'a13835a1b59d9d21c' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 79312\ntool_uses: 31\nduration_ms: 170834</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"613670ba-53bd-4b1d-b980-9ede5aa1e834","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:50:54.150Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Write pytest tests (TDD red phase) for SOS card `sos_226`. CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226`.\n\nCard spec: `cards/sos/sos_226/card_spec.json` (read it; do not assume contents).\nImplementation stub: `cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py`.\n\nConventions:\n- Example engine tests in `engine_tests/` — read `engine_tests/test_casting.py`, `engine_tests/test_triggers.py`, `engine_tests/test_abilities.py`, `engine_tests/test_combat.py` as style references.\n- FDN reference tests: `cards/fdn/fdn_13/tests.py`, `cards/fdn/fdn_142/tests.py`, `cards/fdn/fdn_205/tests.py`, `cards/fdn/fdn_215/tests.py`, `cards/fdn/fdn_244/tests.py`.\n- Shared helpers: `test_utils.py` (+ `test_utils.md`). Use `create_game`, `set_board_state`.\n- Engine API via docstrings: `engine/card.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/replacement_effects.py`, `engine/zones.py`.\n\nReference docs: `KEY_DECISIONS.md` (READ IT — conventions: get_targets()==[] while on stack for ability targets; no gain_life helper; DO NOT add engine.types.Keyword members; reusable infra: BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent, card.mana_spent, GameState.flip_coin, Player.skipped_turns, cast_spell_alternative, miracle-grant registry), `AGENTS.md`, `PROJECT_MAP.md`, `FILES_MODIFIED.json`.\n\nTests must:\n- Be written to `cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py`.\n- Exercise the card's full spec (all keywords/abilities/triggers).\n- Fail before implementation (TDD red).\n- Follow existing conventions exactly.\n\nOutput:\n- `$CARD_DIR/test-rationale.md` — what each test covers and why.\n- `$CARD_DIR/test-files.txt` — test file path(s), one per line.\n- `$CARD_DIR/untestable.json` — array of `{\"requirement\",\"reason\",\"what_would_unblock\"}` ONLY if a spec requirement can't be tested with the current engine API. Omit otherwise.\n\nReturn a short status summary: test file path, number of tests, untestable_count.","agentId":"a13835a1b59d9d21c","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 23\nr