{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A6VsMQ2xj7apqrjfRAgmGM","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 25\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-files.txt\nuntestable_count: 1\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 25 test cases for sos_245 Witherbloom, the Balancer (props, flying/deathtouch, affinity cost-reduction + cast integration); granted-affinity-to-other-spells recorded as untestable.\n\nTest file: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py`. Verified the suite collects cleanly and is in the TDD red phase against the stub (16 failed, 9 passed — the passers are default/no-op or negative-control assertions, not falsely-satisfied behavior checks).\n\nThe one untestable requirement is the clause \"Instant and sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures\": the casting pipeline only honors a spell's own `cost_reduction()` hook and has no central registry by which one permanent can discount a different spell (the FDN 159 reference card models the analogous clause as an inert marker for the same reason). Details and an unblock proposal are in `untestable.json`."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a6f5b19dcc4de135d (use SendMessage with to: 'a6f5b19dcc4de135d' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 79461\ntool_uses: 30\nduration_ms: 155051</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"185e380c-4532-4799-bbe3-98d3eeeff834","timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:58:00.814Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Write pytest tests (TDD red phase) for SOS card `sos_245`. CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245`.\n\nCard spec: `cards/sos/sos_245/card_spec.json` (read it; do not assume contents).\nImplementation stub: `cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py`.\n\nConventions:\n- Example engine tests in `engine_tests/` —