DN tests. After ANY engine change run `pytest engine_tests/` and keep green. If the registry can't be added additively without regression, mark UNVERIFIED and report (but it should be a clean additive change).\n\nReferences: `engine/casting.py` (get_cost_reduction), `engine/game_state.py`, `cards/fdn/fdn_159/card_impl.py`, engine docstrings. `RULEBOOK.txt` (grep) for affinity / cost-reduction rules.\n\nVerify: `pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` all pass; AND `pytest engine_tests/` stays green.\n\nOutputs:\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl.diff` (full diff: `git diff HEAD -- engine/ cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py > $CARD_DIR/impl.diff`).\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-rationale.md` — approach; LIST the engine registry you added and any UNVERIFIED parts.\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-files.txt` — files changed.\n- Upsert this card's entry in `FILES_MODIFIED.json` (root). Match by `card: \"sos_245\"`. Clean up temp files.\n\nReturn IMPL_DONE (files_changed, tests_passing, diff_path, rationale_path, notes — state whether the registry was BUILT or UNVERIFIED) or DISPUTE.","agentId":"acbdd5a482945bd63","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Final state: engine tests fully green, 24/25 sos_245 tests pass, and the one remaining failure is the disputed test that omits main-phase setup (impossible to satisfy without breaking authoritative `engine_tests/`).\n\nThe engine cost-reduction registry was BUILT and verified end-to-end. I'm returning DISPUTE because one test is genuinely impossible as written (not an engine limitation).\n\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: 1\ndisputed_tests: cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py::TestWitherbloomCastingWithAffinity::test_cast_with_three_creatures_pays_reduced_generic (lines 173-193)\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-dispute.md\nnotes: Registry BUILT and green (engine_tests 1145 passed; full suite 1169 passed, 1 failed). The single failure expects `cast_spell` to succeed but never advances `create_game()` past `Phase.BEGINNING`; Witherbloom is a non-flash cr