{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M728AuVEWwfdkiy7TTWkNp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator directives — sos_245 (dispute resolution)\n2\t\n3\t**Decision: the Implementer's feasibility objection is UPHELD.** The disputed test\n4\t`TestWitherbloomCastingWithAffinity::test_cast_with_three_creatures_pays_reduced_generic`\n5\tcasts a non-flash creature (Witherbloom) while the game is still in `Phase.BEGINNING`\n6\t(the `create_game()` default), never advancing to a main phase. Creatures require\n7\tsorcery-speed timing, and the authoritative read-only engine tests\n8\t(`engine_tests/test_casting.py::test_beginning_phase_returns_false`,\n9\t`::test_creature_during_combat_phase_raises`) forbid any additive engine change that\n10\twould let a non-main-phase active-player cast succeed. The cast can therefore never\n11\treach the stack as the test is written.\n12\t\n13\tThe implementation (static data, Flying/Deathtouch, affinity-for-creatures own cost\n14\treduction, and the additive `GameState.spell_cost_reducers` registry summed in\n15\t`engine.casting.get_cost_reduction`) is CORRECT and stays. Do NOT change it.\n16\t\n17\t## Fix ONLY this one test\n18\tIn `cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py`, the test\n19\t`TestWitherbloomCastingWithAffinity::test_cast_with_three_creatures_pays_reduced_generic`\n20\t(~L173-193): add the missing main-phase setup before the `cast_spell(...)` call so the\n21\tsorcery-speed creature can legally be cast, e.g.:\n22\t```python\n23\tfrom engine.types import Phase   # if not already imported\n24\t...\n25\tgame.phase = Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN\n26\tgame.step = None\n27\t```\n28\t(or use `advance_to_phase` if that's the established convention in the file). Keep the\n29\texisting assertion that the spell hits the stack and that 3 creatures reduce the\n30\tgeneric cost so the scripted `{3}{B}{G}` mana pays exactly.\n31\t\n32\tDo NOT modify any other test. Do NOT change the implementation. After the edit, run\n33\t`pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` and confirm all 25 tests pass.\n34\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PFg5XqEDo62ZsYBssDgRPv","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"90aba08f-42f4-4cc2-aae4-da92bfb5047a","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:03:51.698Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Fix disputed sos_245 test"}
