{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01NBTX3jJ21rxpAkAFbQqcUK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01F3eHrtQthtqWtSaw7fDNDM","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-rationale.md","old_string":"`{3}{B}{G}` mana pays exactly. No other test and no implementation file was modified.\nAll 25 tests in the file pass.","new_string":"`{3}{B}{G}` mana pays exactly. No other test and no implementation file was modified.\nAll 25 tests in the file pass.\n\n## Granted-affinity registry tests added (2026-06-01)\n\nThe Implementer BUILT the external cost-reduction registry that was previously\nrecorded as untestable (`GameState.spell_cost_reducers` +\n`register_spell_cost_reducer` / `unregister_spell_cost_reducer` /\n`spell_cost_reduction_from_reducers`, summed by\n`engine.casting.get_cost_reduction`). Witherbloom registers a reducer in\n`register_triggers` granting \"affinity for creatures\" to its controller's OTHER\ninstant/sorcery spells while it is on the battlefield. The previously-untestable\nclause is now fully covered.\n\nNew class `TestWitherbloomGrantsAffinityRegistry` (11 tests). Note that once\nWitherbloom is itself on the battlefield it counts as a creature you control, so\nthe reduction granted to a separate spell is (number of other creatures + 1).\nHelpers `_test_instant` / `_test_sorcery` build vanilla `{N}{R}` spells with no\ncost_reduction() hook of their own (so any reduction observed comes purely from\nthe registry); `_witherbloom_on_battlefield` places Witherbloom + creatures and\ncalls `register_triggers` to activate the reducer (set_board_state bypasses the\nnormal ETB plumbing).\n\n- `test_separate_instant_reduced_by_creature_count` — Witherbloom + 3 bears (4\n  creatures) reduces a separate `{6}{R}` instant's generic by 4.\n- `test_separate_sorcery_reduced_by_creature_count` — the grant applies to\n  sorceries too (2 bears + Witherbloom → reduction 3).\n- `test_reduction_tracks_creature_count_changes` — the reduction scales with the\n  controller's creature count (2 creatures → 2, then 4 creatures → 4).\n- `test_clamped_when_creature_count_exceeds_generic` — with 6 bears + Witherbloom\n  (7 creatures) a `{2}{R}` spell clamps to reduction 2; generic never goes < 0.\n- `test_witherbloom_does_not_reduce_its_own_spell_via_registry` — the registered\n  predicate excludes Witherbloom itself and non-instant/sorcery spells, so a\n  second Witherbloom (a creature spell) gets only its own affinity hook (3), not\n  a doubled registry bonus.\n- `test_opponent_instant_not_reduced` — \"spells YOU cast\": an opponent's instant\n  receives no reduction even with Witherbloom + creatures on the controller's\n  side.\n- `test_creature_spell_not_reduced_by_grant` — the grant is instant/sorcery only;\n  a separate vanilla creature spell the controller casts is unreduced.\n- `test_no_reduction_without_witherbloom_on_battlefield` — registry no-op: with\n  creatures but no Witherbloom in play, the same instant gets reduction 0.\n- `test_unregister_removes_grant` — after `unregister_spell_cost_reducer`, the\n  reduction returns to 0 (models Witherbloom leaving the battlefield).\n- `test_cast_separate_instant_pays_reduced_cost` — end-to-end through\n  `cast_spell`: with Witherbloom + 3 bears, a `{6}{R}` instant is castable for\n  `{2}{R}` and reaches the stack.\n\nAll 35 tests in the file pass. `untestable.json` is now empty."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":100,"cache_read_input_tokens":61017,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":100,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HwcPhRpe1q2HYXdHiQNaBQ","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"4bade