{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GUc1mLLu3Wf7w47XGpBpB8","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All done. Summary of the revision:\n\n**Strict comment (index 0) — applied.** Made `WitherbloomTheBalancer.register_triggers` idempotent: at the top of the method it now calls `game.unregister_spell_cost_reducer(self)` (via a defensive `getattr` guard) to remove any prior reducer with this source before re-registering. This guarantees at most one reducer per source, eliminating both the stale-leak after leave and the critical double-count on blink/recursion re-entry. `unregister_spell_cost_reducer` is identity-based list filtering and is a safe no-op when nothing is registered.\n\n**Advisory (index 1) — applied (optional).** Narrowed the bare `except Exception` in `_count_creatures` and `_is_on_battlefield` to `except (AttributeError, KeyError, LookupError)`.\n\nVerification: `pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` all 35 pass; `pytest engine_tests/` green; full run 1180 passed. No test files modified. Engine changes remain additive.\n\nRelevant absolute paths:\n- `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-revised.diff`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-revised-rationale.md`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/disagreements.json`\n- `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json`\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/disagreements.json"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a84b37e682fd2d14e (use SendMessage with to: 'a84b37e682fd2d14e' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 41542\ntool_uses: 17\nduration_ms: 81354</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"5585defb-cbf1-4a76-b764-bbcf12c6150f","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:12:06.896Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Revision round for SOS card `sos_245` (Witherbloom, the Balancer). Address the reviewer's STRICT comment. CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245`.\n\nCurrent diff: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl.diff`.\nReview: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/review.json`.\nCard spec: `cards/sos/sos_245/card_spec.json`.\nTests (must still all pass, MUST NOT be modified): `cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py`.\n\nSTRICT comment (index 0): The spell-cost reducer is registered in `register_triggers` on EVERY battlefield entry but never unregistered on leave. The engine's leave-battlefield path only unregisters triggers/replacements, NOT the cost reducer. Consequences: (1) a stale reducer leaks after Witherbloom leaves; (2) CRITICAL — on blink/recursion the card re-enters and `register_triggers` runs again, so TWO reducer entries with the same source coexist and BOTH pass the predicate, DOUBLE-counting the affinity reduction. Fix: make registration idempotent and/or wire unregistration to a leave hook. Recommended: at the top of `register_triggers`, call `game.unregister_spell_cost_reducer(self)` (remove any prior reducer with this source) BEFORE re-registering, so only one reducer per source ever exists. Even better if there's a clean additive leave-battlefield hook to also unregister on leave — but the idempotent re-register at minimum eliminates the double-count and stale-leak. Ensure `unregister_spell_cost_reducer` is safe to call when no reducer is registered (no-op, no raise).\n\nYou SHOULD also consider the advisory (bare `except Exception` in helpers) — narrowing it is optional/encouraged but not required.\n\nHARD RULE: Do NOT modify any test file. If you believe the strict comment is wrong, record it in `$CARD_DIR/disagreements.json` (do not silently ignore).\n\nEngine scope: ADDITIVE only; must NOT rename/move/delete existing engine symbols; must NOT touch engine_tests/ or FDN tests. After changes run `pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` (all 35 pass) AND `pytest engine_tests/` (stays green).\n\nOutputs:\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-revised.diff` — full updated diff (`git diff HEAD -- engine/ cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py > $CARD_DIR/impl-revised.diff`).\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-revised-rationale.md` — what changed and why.\n- `$CARD_DIR/disagreements.json` — JSON array of `{\"review_comment_index\",\"reviewer_comment\",\"implementer_justification\"}` for any strict comment you did NOT apply. Empty [] if you applied everything.\n- Update this card's entry in `FILES_MODIFIED.json` in place. Clean up temp files.\n\nReturn: REVISION_DONE with disagreement_count, diff_path, disagreements_path.","agentId":"a84b37e682fd2d14e","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All done. Summary of the revision:\n\n**Strict comment (index 0) — applied.** Made `WitherbloomTheBalancer.register_triggers` idempotent: at the top of the method it now calls `game.unregister_spell_cost_reducer(self)` (via a defensive `getattr` guard) to remove any prior reducer with this source before re-registering. This guarantees at most one reducer per source, eliminating both the stale-leak after leave and the critical double-count on blink/recursion re-entry. `unregister_spell_cost_reducer` is identity-based list filtering and is a safe no-op when nothing is registered.\n\n**Advisory (index 1) — applied (optional).** Narrowed the bare `except Exception` in `_count_creatures` and `_is_on_battlefield` to `except (AttributeError, KeyError, LookupError)`.\n\nVerification: `pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` all 35 pass; `pytest engine_tests/` green; full run 1180 passed. No test files modified. Engine changes remain additive.\n\nRelevant absolute paths:\n- `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-revised.diff`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-revised-rationale.md`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/disagreements.json`\n- `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json`\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/disagreements.json"}],"totalDurationMs":81354,"totalTokens":41542,"totalToolUseCount":17,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":240,"cache_read_input_tokens":40721,"output_tokens":579,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":240},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":579,"cache_read_input_tokens":40721,"cache_creation_input_tokens":240,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":240,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":6,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":5,"editFileCount":6,"linesAdded":89,"linesRemoved":25,"otherToolCount":0}}}
