{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01BhnpM8evd7vBkf21k9Kq9V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Df2oYshJwouBrovHuCsEH5","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — SOS 257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\nFile: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`\n\nGreat Hall of the Biblioplex is a utility land with three abilities:\n\n1. `{T}: Add {C}.`\n2. `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.`\n3. `{5}: If this land isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature with \"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\" It's still a land.`\n\nContract assumed (per repo conventions): mana abilities are exposed via\n`get_mana_abilities()` returning `ManaAbility(cost, mana_produced, ...)` with\ncost signature `(game, source) -> bool` and `mana_produced(game) -> None`\n(mirroring `engine/basic_lands.py`); the animate ability is exposed via\n`get_activated_abilities()` returning a single `ActivatedAbility` with\n`cost(game, source) -> bool` and `effect(game) -> None` (mirroring FDN 35 /\nFDN 249). Triggers are registered through `register_triggers` /\n`game.trigger_manager` and resolved off `game.stack`.\n\n## TestGreatHallProperties\n- `test_is_land` — the card must be an `engine.card.Land`.\n- `test_name` — exact card name.\n- `test_is_land_card_type` — `CardType.LAND` present.\n- `test_not_creature_by_default` — a fresh Hall is a plain land, not a creature\n  (the `{5}` clause only matters because it normally isn't a creature).\n- `test_land_cannot_be_cast` — lands are played, not cast (`can_cast` False).\n\n## TestGreatHallManaAbilities\n- `test_returns_two_mana_abilities` — both mana abilities are advertised.\n- `test_all_are_mana_ability_instances` — each is a `ManaAbility`.\n\n## TestColorlessManaAbility (`{T}: Add {C}`)\n- `test_taps_and_adds_colorless` — paying the cost taps the land; resolving adds\n  exactly one `{C}` to the controller's pool.\n- `test_colorless_ability_cannot_be_used_while_tapped` — tap cost fails when\n  already tapped.\n- `test_colorless_ability_does_not_cost_life` — this ability has no life cost\n  (distinguishes it from the second ability).\n\n## TestAnyColorManaAbility (`{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color`)\n- `test_taps_and_pays_one_life` — cost taps the land and reduces controller life\n  by exactly 1.\n- `test_produces_one_mana` — resolving adds exactly one mana to the pool.\n- `test_can_produce_a_colored_mana` — the produced mana is one of the five colors\n  (\"any color\").\n- `test_any_color_ability_cannot_be_used_while_tapped` — fails when tapped and,\n  importantly, does NOT drain life on a failed activation (cost atomicity).\n\nEdge case covered: the \"spend this mana only on instant/sorcery\" restriction\nsub-clause is NOT asserted — see `untestable.json` (no restricted-mana API on\n`ManaPool`). The any-color production and the life payment are still verified.\n\n## TestAnimateAbility (`{5}: become a 2/4 Wizard creature`)\n- `test_returns_one_activated_ability` — exactly one `ActivatedAbility`.\n- `test_cost_requires_five_generic_mana` — fewer than 5 mana → cost fails.\n- `test_cost_pays_five_generic_mana` — 5 mana → cost succeeds and drains the pool.\n- `test_effect_makes_it_a_creature` — animation adds `CardType.CREATURE`.\n- `test_effect_sets_two_four_power_toughness` — becomes 2/4.\n- `test_effect_adds_wizard_subtype` — gains the Wizard subtype.\n- `test_remains_a_land_after_animation` — \"It's still a land.\" LAND type retained.\n- `test_animation_is_noop_when_already_a_creature` — \"If this land isn't a\n  creature\" guard: re-activating must not stack a second animation (stays 2/4).\n\n## TestAnimatedProwessTrigger (the granted prowess-style ability)\n- `test_casting_instant_pumps_animated_creature` — after animation, casting an\n  instant fires `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`; resolving the trigger gives +1/+0\n  (power +1, toughness unchanged).\n- `test_animated_creature_pumps_once_per_spell` — two instants → +2/+0\n  cumulatively (one trigger per spell).\n- `test_no_pump_before_animation` — before becoming a creature, casting an\n  instant must not turn it into a creature or grant a power bonus (the granted\n  ability only exists while animated). This is one of two checks that pass\n  against the empty stub; it remains a meaningful guard post-implementation.\n\n## Edge cases intentionally NOT covered\n- The instant/sorcery spend-restriction on the any-color mana (see\n  `untestable.json`).\n- \"Whenever you cast\" controller scoping (only YOUR spells trigger): the engine\n  test surface fires events with an explicit controller, but verifying the\n  condition rejects an opponent's spell would depend on implementation-internal\n  condition wiring not yet fixed by the contract; left out to avoid coupling the\n  test to internals. The single-controller pump behavior is the load-bearing\n  requirement and is covered.\n- \"Until end of turn\" expiry of the +1/+0 across a turn boundary: depends on the\n  engine's end-of-turn cleanup running over a full turn loop; out of scope for a\n  local-behavior contract.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":665,"cache_read_input_tokens":74211,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":665,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":60,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01D7aVRbcpDiQykdQJHbEAom","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"eefebdca-4efb-4cea-b457-ac2e9d9b4f17","request_id":"req_011CbcN7eDcQftLeYBdPFe8j","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_257"}
