eate_game`, `set_board_state`.\n- Engine API via docstrings: `engine/card.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/replacement_effects.py`, `engine/zones.py`.\n\nReference docs: `KEY_DECISIONS.md` (READ IT — conventions: get_targets()==[] while on stack for ability targets; no gain_life helper; DO NOT add engine.types.Keyword members; reusable infra: BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent, card.mana_spent, GameState.flip_coin, Player.skipped_turns, cast_spell_alternative, miracle-grant registry, GameState.spell_cost_reducers registry; sorcery-speed creatures need a main phase set in casting tests), `AGENTS.md`, `PROJECT_MAP.md`, `FILES_MODIFIED.json`.\n\nTests must:\n- Be written to `cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`.\n- Exercise the card's full spec (all keywords/abilities/triggers).\n- Fail before implementation (TDD red).\n- Follow existing conventions exactly.\n\nOutput:\n- `$CARD_DIR/test-rationale.md` — what each test covers and why.\n- `$CARD_DIR/test-files.txt` — test file path(s), one per line.\n- `$CARD_DIR/untestable.json` — array of `{\"requirement\",\"reason\",\"what_would_unblock\"}` ONLY if a spec requirement can't be tested with the current engine API. Omit otherwise.\n\nReturn a short status summary: test file path, number of tests, untestable_count.","agentId":"a19d4dc6c0dc97859","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 25\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-files.txt\nuntestable_count: 1\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 25 test cases for sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex (land mana abilities, life-pay any-color, {5} animate to 2/4 Wizard, prowess-style pump); 23 fail / 2 trivially-true guards pass against the empty stub (TDD red phase confirmed).\n\nTest file: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`. The one untestable sub-clause is the \"spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" restriction — `engine.mana.ManaPool` has no restricted/earmarked-mana API to assert it."}],"totalDurationMs":182633,"totalTokens":77542,"totalToolUseCount":39,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2334,"cache_read_input_tokens":74876,"output_tokens":330,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2334},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":330,"cache_read_input_tokens":74876,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2334,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2334,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":20,"searchCount":11,"bashCount":3,"editFileCount":5,"linesAdded":426,"linesRemoved":46,"otherToolCount":0}}}
