{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mk3psaBBYaAh6uFe5yLaVA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator directives — sos_257 (Great Hall of the Biblioplex)\n2\t\n3\t## Build (in scope, fully tested)\n4\tRead card_spec.json for exact text. Build fully:\n5\t- The land and its basic mana ability/abilities.\n6\t- \"{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color.\" — the any-color production AND the\n7\t  1-life payment.\n8\t- The \"{5}: this land becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature ...\" animation ability (and the\n9\t  resulting creature's keywords/P-T per spec; it remains a land).\n10\t- The prowess-style pump (\"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this gets\n11\t  +1/+1 until end of turn\" or per spec).\n12\tMake ALL current tests in `cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` pass. Follow KEY_DECISIONS.md\n13\tconventions (no Keyword enum additions; reuse existing infra where relevant).\n14\t\n15\t## \"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" — attempt LOW-RISK, else UNVERIFIED\n16\t`engine.mana.ManaPool` currently stores only `dict[ManaType, int]` with no concept of\n17\trestricted/earmarked mana, and the payment path is core and heavily tested.\n18\t\n19\t- You MAY add a LOW-RISK, no-op-by-default restricted-mana facility ONLY IF it is\n20\t  clean and strictly backward-compatible: e.g. an optional \"tagged/restricted mana\"\n21\t  side-structure on ManaPool with a usable-for predicate, defaulting to unrestricted,\n22\t  and a casting-time check consulted only when restricted mana exists. The DEFAULT\n23\t  (no restricted mana) MUST be a strict no-op so all existing mana/casting tests are\n24\t  unaffected.\n25\t- If that facility risks regressing `engine_tests/` (especially mana/casting tests)\n26\t  or requires non-additive changes to ManaPool or the payment path, DO NOT force it.\n27\t  Leave the mana pipeline untouched and mark the restriction\n28\t  `# UNVERIFIED: <requirement> — <reason>` in `cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`. The\n29\t  any-color production and life payment are already covered.\n30\t\n31\t## Constraints\n32\t- Make ALL tests pass; do NOT modify tests.\n33\t- Engine changes ADDITIVE only; after ANY engine change run `pytest engine_tests/`\n34\t  and keep it green. Do NOT add Keyword enum members. Do NOT touch engine_tests/ or\n35\t  FDN tests. Clean up temp files (no FILES_MODIFIED.json.tmp).\n36\t- Prefer a green engine_tests/ suite and correct in-scope behavior over the\n37\t  restriction sub-clause.\n38\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011qwqQLHVmvG6t7NNweJeMi","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"92d2f993-e272-4dd9-bc83-08c3860ac9e0","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:16:35.157Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257"}
