{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AtA7dGZ6naaHh5Zwpmy8j2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"requirement\": \"{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.\",\n4\t    \"reason\": \"engine.mana.ManaPool stores only dict[ManaType, int] counts with no concept of restricted/earmarked mana. There is no API to assert that mana produced by this ability may be spent only on instant/sorcery spells (or to verify it is rejected when paying for a creature/land/other spell). The any-color production and the 1-life payment ARE tested; only the spend-restriction sub-clause is unverifiable.\",\n5\t    \"what_would_unblock\": \"A restricted-mana facility on ManaPool (e.g. tagged mana with a usable-for predicate) plus a casting-time check, exposing a queryable restriction so a test can assert the produced mana is consumable only by instant/sorcery casts.\"\n6\t  }\n7\t]\n8\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011qwqQLHVmvG6t7NNweJeMi","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"2b00ef7c-8545-4fc2-9b9b-55dc255b5ba9","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:16:36.103Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257"}
