{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01V6Lded6hGVkPPgZHmgEmPn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NmYx4S6rPfwHek8a22AVuY","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md","content":"# sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex — Implementation Rationale\n\n## Approach\n`GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex` subclasses `engine.card.Land`. All behavior lives in the\ncard class; NO engine files were modified.\n\n### Mana abilities (`get_mana_abilities` → 2 `ManaAbility`)\n1. `{T}: Add {C}.` — cost taps (guards on `is_tapped`); `mana_produced` adds one\n   `ManaType.COLORLESS`.\n2. `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color.` — cost taps then subtracts 1 life\n   (only after the tap guard passes, so a failed cost never drains life);\n   `mana_produced` adds one colored mana (GREEN chosen as the default color).\n\n### Animate ability (`get_activated_abilities` → 1 `ActivatedAbility`)\n- `cost` pays `{5}` generic via `controller.mana_pool.can_pay`/`pay`.\n- `effect` calls `_animate`, which is a no-op if already a creature\n  (\"If this land isn't a creature\"), otherwise adds `CardType.CREATURE` +\n  `\"Wizard\"` subtype, sets base 2/4, keeps `CardType.LAND` (\"It's still a land\"),\n  registers the prowess trigger, and registers a TYPE-layer `ContinuousEffect`.\n\n### Prowess-style pump\n- `power`/`toughness` are properties (`Land` has none): `power = base + _power_bonus`.\n- `register_triggers` registers the prowess trigger ONLY when already a creature, so\n  an un-animated land never gains a bonus (covered by `test_no_pump_before_animation`).\n- The trigger watches `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`; condition requires the source still\n  be a creature, the spell's controller match, and the spell be INSTANT/SORCERY.\n  Effect does `_power_bonus += 1` (one trigger per spell → cumulative +N/+0).\n\n### Why a continuous effect for the animation\n`EffectManager.apply_all()` resets battlefield objects via `_reset_characteristics()`,\nwhich restores `card_types` to the printed snapshot (`{LAND}`) — wiping the added\nCREATURE type. The prowess tests call `apply_all` between spells, which silently\nde-animated the land and broke the second pump. To survive recalculation, `_animate`\nregisters a permanent TYPE-layer `ContinuousEffect` that re-adds CREATURE + Wizard on\nevery `apply_all`. `_power_bonus` is a plain attribute untouched by\n`_reset_characteristics`, so it persists naturally.\n\n## Engine changes\nNONE. `pytest engine_tests/` stays fully green (1145 passed).\n\n## UNVERIFIED\n- **\"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.\"** — Restricted-mana\n  facility NOT built. `engine.mana.ManaPool` stores only `dict[ManaType, int]` with no\n  concept of tagged/earmarked mana, and the casting payment path is core and heavily\n  tested. A no-op-by-default restricted-mana facility could not be added without risking\n  regressions to the mana/casting pipeline, so per the coordinator directive the\n  restriction is left unenforced (the any-color production and 1-life payment ARE\n  modelled). Marked with a grep-able `# UNVERIFIED:` comment inside\n  `_anycolor_produced` in `card_impl.py`.\n\n## Conventions for future cards\n- For \"becomes a creature / animate\" on a non-Creature base (Land/Artifact), register a\n  TYPE-layer `ContinuousEffect` (not just a one-shot `card_types.add`) so the animation\n  survives `EffectManager.apply_all()` resets. Use an `_animated` flag so the effect's\n  apply is conditional and a second activation is a no-op.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":291,"cache_read_input_tokens":59454,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":291,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":62,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011qwqQLHVmvG6t7NNweJeMi","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"8f1f4cf5-7d93-4149-926e-86c68d9fda47","request_id":"req_011CbcNRipvasdzvnf7L44J7","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257"}
