{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DfsbeHwAwNME5DhDzXDG7d","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex — Implementation Rationale\n2\t\n3\t## Approach\n4\t`GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex` subclasses `engine.card.Land`. All behavior lives in the\n5\tcard class; NO engine files were modified.\n6\t\n7\t### Mana abilities (`get_mana_abilities` → 2 `ManaAbility`)\n8\t1. `{T}: Add {C}.` — cost taps (guards on `is_tapped`); `mana_produced` adds one\n9\t   `ManaType.COLORLESS`.\n10\t2. `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color.` — cost taps then subtracts 1 life\n11\t   (only after the tap guard passes, so a failed cost never drains life);\n12\t   `mana_produced` adds one colored mana (GREEN chosen as the default color).\n13\t\n14\t### Animate ability (`get_activated_abilities` → 1 `ActivatedAbility`)\n15\t- `cost` pays `{5}` generic via `controller.mana_pool.can_pay`/`pay`.\n16\t- `effect` calls `_animate`, which is a no-op if already a creature\n17\t  (\"If this land isn't a creature\"), otherwise adds `CardType.CREATURE` +\n18\t  `\"Wizard\"` subtype, sets base 2/4, keeps `CardType.LAND` (\"It's still a land\"),\n19\t  registers the prowess trigger, and registers a TYPE-layer `ContinuousEffect`.\n20\t\n21\t### Prowess-style pump\n22\t- `power`/`toughness` are properties (`Land` has none): `power = base + _power_bonus`.\n23\t- `register_triggers` registers the prowess trigger ONLY when already a creature, so\n24\t  an un-animated land never gains a bonus (covered by `test_no_pump_before_animation`).\n25\t- The trigger watches `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`; condition requires the source still\n26\t  be a creature, the spell's controller match, and the spell be INSTANT/SORCERY.\n27\t  Effect does `_power_bonus += 1` (one trigger per spell → cumulative +N/+0).\n28\t\n29\t### Why a continuous effect for the animation\n30\t`EffectManager.apply_all()` resets battlefield objects via `_reset_characteristics()`,\n31\twhich restores `card_types` to the printed snapshot (`{LAND}`) — wiping the added\n32\tCREATURE type. The prowess tests call `apply_all` between spells, which silently\n33\tde-animated the land and broke the second pump. To survive recalculation, `_animate`\n34\tregisters a permanent TYPE-layer `ContinuousEffect` that re-adds CREATURE + Wizard on\n35\tevery `apply_all`. `_power_bonus` is a plain attribute untouched by\n36\t`_reset_characteristics`, so it persists naturally.\n37\t\n38\t## Engine changes\n39\tNONE. `pytest engine_tests/` stays fully green (1145 passed).\n40\t\n41\t## UNVERIFIED\n42\t- **\"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.\"** — Restricted-mana\n43\t  facility NOT built. `engine.mana.ManaPool` stores only `dict[ManaType, int]` with no\n44\t  concept of tagged/earmarked mana, and the casting payment path is core and heavily\n45\t  tested. A no-op-by-default restricted-mana facility could not be added without risking\n46\t  regressions to the mana/casting pipeline, so per the coordinator directive the\n47\t  restriction is left unenforced (the any-color production and 1-life payment ARE\n48\t  modelled). Marked with a grep-able `# UNVERIFIED:` comment inside\n49\t  `_anycolor_produced` in `card_impl.py`.\n50\t\n51\t## Conventions for future cards\n52\t- For \"becomes a creature / animate\" on a non-Creature base (Land/Artifact), register a\n53\t  TYPE-layer `ContinuousEffect` (not just a one-shot `card_types.add`) so the animation\n54\t  survives `EffectManager.apply_all()` resets. Use an `_animated` flag so the effect's\n55\t  apply is conditional and a second activation is a no-op.\n56\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TE9thFw8in75t2FnPd8KSA","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"11353f20-4ad5-4b7a-84fa-714b52be55a1","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:20:34.539Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_257"}
