{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_019xoYHvZabzaPWuFbV5HGhN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MPoDpzG8VSoUV71mMKBu7C","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/review.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"severity\": \"strict\",\n    \"file\": \"cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py\",\n    \"line\": 246,\n    \"comment\": \"Prowess pump is not 'until end of turn' — it is permanent. The trigger does `source._power_bonus += 1` into a plain instance attribute, and `power` returns `_base_power + _power_bonus`. Nothing ever decrements `_power_bonus`: the engine's end-of-turn cleanup (engine/turn.py step 2) only calls `effect_manager.remove_expired()` + `apply_all()`, and `CardImpl._reset_characteristics()`/`Creature._reset_characteristics()` only reset `card_types`, `keywords`, and `modified_*` — none touch `_power_bonus`. So a Hall that casts two instants on turn 3 is permanently +2/+0 on turns 4, 5, ... which contradicts the spec/oracle text 'gets +1/+0 until end of turn.' The established convention for this exact pattern (see cards/fdn/fdn_83 'gets +3/+0 until end of turn') is to register a `ContinuousEffect(layer=Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS, sublayer=SubLayer.MODIFY_PT, duration=DURATION_END_OF_TURN)` so the bonus is swept by `remove_expired` at cleanup. The in-run tests only assert accumulation within a single turn, so they don't catch the missing expiry.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"severity\": \"advisory\",\n    \"file\": \"cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py\",\n    \"line\": 120,\n    \"comment\": \"The 'add one mana of any color' ability always produces GREEN with no way for the controller to choose a different color. Tests only require that some colored mana is produced, and there is no color-choice infrastructure being exercised here, so this is acceptable for now; noting that it does not yet honor 'any color' (the controller cannot pick white/blue/black/red).\"\n  }\n]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":424,"cache_read_input_tokens":40990,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":424,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TE9thFw8in75t2FnPd8KSA","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"1cd7284d-be4e-4f52-8dca-0c3d49bef655","request_id":"req_011CbcNcDc5Tb43UJ3NAAomu","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_257"}
