URN continuous-effect pattern), `engine/continuous_effects.py` / `engine/card.py` (layers, duration), `engine/turn.py` (cleanup).\n\nOutputs:\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-revised.diff` — full updated diff (`git diff HEAD -- engine/ cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py > $CARD_DIR/impl-revised.diff`).\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-revised-rationale.md` — what changed and why.\n- `$CARD_DIR/disagreements.json` — JSON array of `{\"review_comment_index\",\"reviewer_comment\",\"implementer_justification\"}` for any strict comment you did NOT apply. Empty [] if you applied everything.\n- Update this card's entry in `FILES_MODIFIED.json` in place. Clean up temp files.\n\nReturn: REVISION_DONE with disagreement_count, diff_path, disagreements_path."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019WkGf7oeuD1zaqTQz8z1KJ","session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"659f66ea-0c77-4545-9008-359b4eee71d9","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:22:28.760Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revise sos_257 per review"}
