{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019WkGf7oeuD1zaqTQz8z1KJ","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All tests pass (25 card + 1145 engine = 1170 total).\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/disagreements.json\n\nnotes: Applied the STRICT fix — the prowess +1/+0 pump is now a `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` MODIFY_PT `ContinuousEffect` (mirroring `cards/fdn/fdn_83`), and an added `_reset_characteristics` override on the Land zeroes `_power_bonus` so the engine's end-of-turn `remove_expired` + `apply_all` cleanup clears the buff. Verified the buff is +1 within the turn and reverts to base after cleanup. No engine files modified (additive-only satisfied); all 25 card tests and 1145 engine tests pass. The advisory (\"any color\" always produces green) was acknowledged but intentionally not changed — no color-choice infrastructure exists and tests only require one colored mana. Relevant file: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a37af29c7ef1502c4 (use SendMessage with to: 'a37af29c7ef1502c4' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 38357\ntool_uses: 24\nduration_ms: 119545</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6f4bd5-6767-4f31-a917-ac0bdc13b45e","uuid":"e842f52f-b4a5-43ee-8073-284b87876ad1","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:24:28.305Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Revision round for SOS card `sos_257` (Great Hall of the Biblioplex). Address the reviewer's STRICT comment. CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257`.\n\nCurrent diff: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl.diff`.\nReview: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/review.json`.\nCard spec: `cards/sos/sos_257/card_spec.json`.\nTests (must still all pass, MUST NOT be modified): `cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`.\n\nSTRICT comment (index 0): The prowess-style pump accumulates into a plain `_power_bonus` attribute (power property ~line 64, trigger effect ~line 246) that is NEVER reset at end of turn. This makes the +1/+0 buff PERMANENT instead of \"until end of turn\" as the spec requires. The engine cleanup step and `_reset_characteristics` never touch `_power_bonus`. Fix: model the pump as a duration-limited continuous effect that expires at end of turn, following the established convention in `cards/fdn/fdn_83/card_impl.py` — a `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` continuous effect in the POWER_TOUGHNESS / MODIFY_PT layer (so the engine's end-of-turn cleanup removes it). Each instant/sorcery cast should add one such until-end-of-turn +1/+0 (stacking within the turn, then all clearing at end of turn).\n\nYou SHOULD also consider the advisory comment — applying it is optional.\n\nHARD RULE: Do NOT modify any test file. If you believe the strict comment is wrong, record it in `$CARD_DIR/disagreements.json` (do not silently ignore). Note: the current tests pass even with the bug, so after your fix they must STILL all pass — make sure the until-end-of-turn effect still yields the buffed P/T within the same turn that the tests observe.\n\nEngine scope: ADDITIVE only; must NOT rename/move/delete existing engine symbols; must NOT touch engine_tests/ or FDN tests. After changes run `pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` (all 25 pass) AND `pytest engine_tests/` (stays green).\n\nReferences: `cards/fdn/fdn_83/card_impl.py` (DURATION_END_OF_TURN continuous-effect pattern), `engine/continuous_effects.py` / `engine/card.py` (layers, duration), `engine/turn.py` (cleanup).\n\nOutputs:\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-revised.diff` — full updated diff (`git diff HEAD -- engine/ cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py > $CARD_DIR/impl-revised.diff`).\n- `$CARD_DIR/impl-revised-rationale.md` — what changed and why.\n- `$CARD_DIR/disagreements.json` — JSON array of `{\"review_comment_index\",\"reviewer_comment\",\"implementer_justification\"}` for any strict comment you did NOT apply. Empty [] if you applied everything.\n- Update this card's entry in `FILES_MODIFIED.json` in place. Clean up temp files.\n\nReturn: REVISION_DONE with disagreement_count, diff_path, disagreements_path.","agentId":"a37af29c7ef1502c4","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All tests pass (25 card + 1145 engine = 1170 total).\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/disagreements.json\n\nnotes: Applied the STRICT fix — the prowess +1/+0 pump is now a `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` MODIFY_PT `ContinuousEffect` (mirroring `cards/fdn/fdn_83`), and an added `_reset_characteristics` override on the Land zeroes `_power_bonus` so the engine's end-of-turn `remove_expired` + `apply_all` cleanup clears the buff. Verified the buff is +1 within the turn and reverts to base after cleanup. No engine files modified (additive-only satisfied); all 25 card tests and 1145 engine tests pass. The advisory (\"any color\" always produces green) was acknowledged but intentionally not changed — no color-choice infrastructure exists and tests only require one colored mana. Relevant file: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`."}],"totalDurationMs":119545,"totalTokens":38357,"totalToolUseCount":24,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204,"cache_read_input_tokens":37753,"output_tokens":398,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":204},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":37753,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":204,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":7,"searchCount":1,"bashCount":11,"editFileCount":5,"linesAdded":123,"linesRemoved":19,"otherToolCount":0}}}
