{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01F86LTRhYoxMC2RQvxM3VPP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Working tree is clean. All 10 SOS cards are implemented, tested, and committed.\n\n## Summary\n\nAll 10 cards (`sos_1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257`) were implemented through the TDD Tester → Implementer → Reviewer loop, one card per commit. **Final state: 1393 tests pass (all SOS card tests + the full engine regression suite), working tree clean.**\n\n### Per-card outcomes\n- **sos_1** (The Dawning Archaic) — graveyard cost reduction, Reach, attack-trigger free-cast with exile redirect. 1 strict review fixed (card-level `get_targets` wrongly required a target when cast).\n- **sos_4** (Together as One) — Converge X effect. Resolved a test dispute (contradictory `chosen_targets` data) in the Implementer's favor; Tester corrected the one test.\n- **sos_13** (Emeritus // Swords to Plowshares) — ETB Inkling token + conditional `is_prepared`. Copy-cast/instant face marked UNVERIFIED; discovered the **locked 16-member `Keyword` enum** constraint.\n- **sos_57** (Mana Sculpt) — counterspell + Wizard-gated delayed `{C}`. Built additive `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` + `card.mana_spent`.\n- **sos_97** (Ral Zarek) — planeswalker; built additive `GameState.flip_coin` + `Player.skipped_turns`.\n- **sos_120** (Improvisation Capstone) — exile-until-MV≥4 free-cast; \"Paradigm\" copy-cast UNVERIFIED.\n- **sos_201** (Lorehold) — built additive `cast_spell_alternative` + miracle-grant registry + draw-window hook.\n- **sos_226** (Silverquill) — casualty via card-local helpers; as-you-cast pipeline integration UNVERIFIED (protected the cast pipeline).\n- **sos_245** (Witherbloom) — built additive `GameState.spell_cost_reducers` registry. Resolved a feasibility dispute (missing main-phase setup) + fixed a strict double-counting bug on re-entry.\n- **sos_257** (Great Hall of the Biblioplex) — man-land via TYPE-la